docs/*

# Full-size sources for the WIP site's derivatives. Every one of these is the
# original a committed web copy was encoded from — keep them locally so a
# derivative can be regenerated, but they are megabytes each and no page ever
# requests them. See "The size budget" in WIP/CLAUDE.md.
*_full.jpg
*_full.png
WIP/img/Intro.mp4

# ── Output of WIP/generate_pages.py ──
# ~240 files: one index.html per post, member, publication and section, plus a
# redirect stub for every old-site URL. They are built in CI from the manifests
# and the index.html shell, so committing them would churn 240 files on every
# content edit and bury the one-line change that actually happened.
#
# WIP/index.html is NOT ignored — it is the template these are generated from.
# Nor is WIP/404.html, which is hand-written.
WIP/news/*/index.html
WIP/news/index.html
WIP/people/*/index.html
WIP/people/index.html
WIP/publications/*/index.html
WIP/publications/index.html
WIP/research/index.html
WIP/research/*/index.html
WIP/information/
WIP/join/
WIP/services/
WIP/post/
WIP/publication/
WIP/authors/
WIP/jobs/
WIP/__pycache__/